{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-8","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：三边分别相等","englishTitle":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, and have also the base equal to the base, they will also have the angles equal which are contained by the equal straight lines.","book":1,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","contentId":"euclid-1-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf4585258989f7b795e074f0f6fe9159e445e0c0801067a8cb5d1270382a758b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-8.statement","euclid-1-8.construction.1","euclid-1-8.proof.1","euclid-1-8.proof.2","euclid-1-8.proof.3","euclid-1-8.proof.4","euclid-1-8.proof.5","euclid-1-8.conclusion","euclid-1-8.historical.1","euclid-1-8.historical.2","euclid-1-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8f1753e350688a388175e791ffb62225b69b390f7652fb02dce97d30a8bf74c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, and have also the base equal to the base, they will also have the angles equal which are contained by the equal straight lines."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形的两边分别等于两边,底边和底边等,它们也具有相等的角,这些角由相等的直线组成。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形，若相当之两腰各等，两底亦等，则两腰间角必等。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于两个三角形，如果两条对边的两条边相等，并且底边也相等，那么两条边之间的角必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77539126c6cc0eeaa5a264948e897f2a730a89ca9cdecfbb8f1bce9d9bc1b5a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having the two sides AB, AC equal to the two sides DE, DF respectively, namely AB to DE, and AC to DF; and let them have the base BC equal to the base EF;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF成为两个三角,双方的AB、AC和DE等同,即AB至DE和AC至DF;让它们拥有底边至BC等同底边至EF等同;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8b253a290caaea23777088088bc4df2148fabfafe10a070017c005103f3a297","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angle BAC is also equal to the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,BAC角度也等于EDF角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3c4e08c55e3aa5ae6455cc626efe53a265e5d9ad62c5628c6528d25da75f8ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the triangle ABC be applied to the triangle DEF, and if the point B be placed on the point E and the straight line BC on EF, the point C will also coincide with F, because BC is equal to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果三角ABC适用于三角DEF,如果点B位于E点,直线EF线BC,则点C也与F相吻合,因为BC等于EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fced8a94f596a6238cde60da07c0607c450579d3aaaf87ccd62fae3e723361cd","citations":["euclid-1-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, BC coinciding with EF, BA, AC will also coincide with ED, DF; for, if the base BC coincides with the base EF, and the sides BA, AC do not coincide with ED, DF but fall beside them as EG, GF, then, given two straight lines constructed on a straight line (from its extremities) and meeting in a point, there will have been constructed on the same straight line (from its extremities), and on the same side of it, two other straight lines meeting in another point and equal to the former two respectively, namely each to that which has the same extremity with it. But they cannot be so constructed. [[I. 7](/principles/euclid-1-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC起,EF起,BA起,AC起,ED起,DF起;因为如果底边 BC公路与底边 EF公路重合,而双方的BA AC公路与ED DF公路不吻合,但相邻的公路则为EG GF公路,那么,如果在一条直线上(从它的极端)建造了两条直线,并且在一个点上相交,那么在同一条直线上(从它的极端)将建造另外两条直线,在另一点上相交,与前两条线相等,即每一条直线与直线的直线相同。但它们不能如此构建。 [[I. 7](/principles/euclid-1-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae35bb08df786071110e7b59fad1dbd1a86949c55833a9954aa9a676a6a7b34e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is not possible that, if the base BC be applied to the base EF, the sides BA, AC should not coincide with ED, DF; they will therefore coincide, so that the angle BAC will also coincide with the angle EDF, and will be equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果底边 BC指令适用于底边 EF,则BA AC协议与ED DF协议不吻合,因此,它们会同时出现,这样,BAC协议的视角也将与EDF协议的视角相吻合,并且将等同于这一角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcb7d031b4b9cc4e687be89a5d645db5f80fb32f5788cdccc31dad323d56a015","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54db08ffa47be490e020ec464692a88c83291ff29d165a6fd9fbe1914a1c8de0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形，若相当之两腰各等，两底亦等，则两腰间角必等。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于两个三角形，如果两条对边的两条边相等，并且底边也相等，那么两条边之间的角必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e2eb498bfc9ebd1fdef91951d22ef4f56994ffb9e4cde1185f2aeae8db9c4f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"系：本题止论甲丁角，若旋转依法论之，即三角皆同可见。凡线等则角必等，不可疑也。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"联系：这个问题只讨论 甲丁 上的角；如果按照规律来判断旋转，那么所有三角形都可以看作相同。如果线条相等，那么角度必须相等，所以毫无疑问。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-8.source","contentId":"euclid-1-8","revisionId":"euclid-1-8@raw-cf4585258989f7b7","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c421eab46992ee67fbdf127308d1f652ad85c82eaeac432566adaf78cc15e469","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-8:euclid-1-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-8.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.